# Lunora endpoint for the browser + SSR client. Rsbuild statically replaces
# `import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LUNORA_URL` at dev / build time.
#
# Leave it unset: the browser uses the page origin (`rsbuild dev` proxies
# `/_lunora/*` to the Worker, and in production one Worker serves both), and
# SSR in dev calls the Worker directly. Set it to point the client at a
# deployed Worker:
#
# PUBLIC_LUNORA_URL=https://my-app.example.workers.dev
